; metatag), not UNIQUE. A grenade-plus-mine Kit, the Havok Charges' shape (ms_havok_charges.tres).
; THROW FIRST: get_solo_action is the applier the detach's save reads (action_system_clear_buff.gd:99).
; SP6 draws the glyph (throw, mine, attached buff, detach: one family).
